===Etymology===
{{etyl|la}} {{term|post||afterwards|lang=la}} + {{term|mortem}} from {{term|mors||death}}.

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|sg='''[[post]] [[mortem]]'''|-}}

# Occurring after [[death]].
#: ''The injuries were found to have been caused '''post mortem'''.''

