===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[post]] [[mortem]]}} (abbreviated as ''[[PM]]'')

# An [[investigation]] of a [[corpse]] to determine the cause of [[death]]; an [[autopsy]]
# {{figurative|management}} Any investigation after something considered unsuccessful, especially used of meetings, games and sports, software development, and projects of any kind.

